  "arguments": {
    "hypothesis": "The bug is likely in the handling of nested tags when case preservation is enabled. The parser is not correctly closing the first tag before opening a new one, leading to incorrect nesting. This issue might be in the methods responsible for tag closure and nesting in the HtmlTreeBuilder class."
